Modifications: the original PyTorch weights
  resources/anti_spoof_models/2.7_80x80_MiniFASNetV2.pth
  resources/anti_spoof_models/4_0_0_80x80_MiniFASNetV1SE.pth
were converted to ONNX (opset 13) without changing the weights, producing
  minifasnet_v2_2.7_80x80.onnx
  minifasnet_v1se_4.0_80x80.onnx
The conversion script is tools/convert_minifasnet.py in this repository.

Input: 1x3x80x80 float32, BGR, pixel values 0-255 (not normalized).
Output: 3 logits; class 1 is "real face".
